module defer_stmt.neg_1

// NOVAC_EXPECT `defer` is not compiled yet
// ONE seeded cause: `defer { ... }` (D90). The word is lexed and the form
// parses whole since 2026-10-31 (task 134), so the refusal names the honest
// debt -- running the body at scope exit is the E2 horizon's -- instead of
// the old lie, where `defer` lexed as a NAME and the brace read as a record
